  VALUE: KM271-SYA-104

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: KM271-HW-051
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Functional
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Met
TITLE: Oil meter input
STATEMENT: >>>
One input shall accept a 5 V pulse signal (e.g. reed contact of an oil meter)
without exceeding 3.3 V at the controller pin.
<<<
COMMENT: J6 pin 2: R9 series resistor, R16 1 kOhm pull-down.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYS-021
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYA-014

