PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Met
TITLE: OneWire bus
STATEMENT: >>>
The board shall provide a OneWire bus with a fitted pull-up resistor and a
series resistor at the controller pin.
<<<
COMMENT: GPIO15, R6 10 Ohm, R49 1 kOhm via R57.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYS-021
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYA-014

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: KM271-HW-053
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Interface
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Met
TITLE: Sensor supply outputs
STATEMENT: >>>
The sensor terminal shall provide GND, +3V3 and +5V for external sensors.
<<<
RELATIONS:
