STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Interface
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Met
TITLE: Extension header pinout
STATEMENT: >>>
The extension header J7 shall keep the 2x5 pin assignment of v1.x (power, SPI,
I2C, nINT) so that existing extensions remain mechanically and electrically
compatible.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYS-022
