STATUS: Draft
TYPE: EMC
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Met
TITLE: SPI series termination
STATEMENT: >>>
The SPI lines on J7 shall have series resistors (22 Ohm) at the controller
side.
<<<
COMMENT: R45-R48.
