TYPE: Functional
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Met
TITLE: I2C pull-ups
STATEMENT: >>>
SDA and SCL shall each have exactly one pull-up resistor to +3V3 on the main
