[REQUIREMENT]
UID: KM271-HW-080
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Mechanical
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Met
TITLE: Guide rail clearance
STATEMENT: >>>
Components and copper (except the card edge contacts) shall keep at least 1.3
mm distance to the board edges that run in the guide rails of the slot.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYS-040
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYA-018

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: KM271-HW-081
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: EMC
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Review
COMPLIANCE: Partially met
TITLE: Continuous ground return
STATEMENT: >>>
Fast signals (SPI, USB, UART, switching node) shall have a continuous GND
reference on the adjacent layer. Traces on the GND layer shall not cut the
plane below them.
<<<
SOURCE: EMC review 2026-11-24
COMMENT: >>>
Open: B.Cu bundle J4/Q1/Q2/+3V3 at x 140-146 cuts GND below the F.Cu bus (low
priority, USB only used for service). Bottleneck at the J1 tongue is inherent
to the shape.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYS-042
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYA-018

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: KM271-HW-082
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: EMC
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Review
COMPLIANCE: Met
TITLE: Compact power loop
STATEMENT: >>>
Input capacitor, converter IC and output capacitor of the step-down converter
shall form a minimal loop with direct GND connection.
<<<
SOURCE: EMC review 2026-11-24 (rework 2026-11-24)
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYS-042
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYA-018
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYA-201

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: KM271-HW-083
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: EMC
PRIORITY: Should
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Met
