GND areas on both layers shall be stitched along the board edge with a via
pitch of about 4 mm where both layers carry GND.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYS-042
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYA-018

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: KM271-HW-084
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Manufacturing
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Met
TITLE: Thermal reliefs
STATEMENT: >>>
GND pads of components shall be connected with thermal reliefs. Only exposed
pads shall be fully connected.
<<<
RATIONALE: Solderability during production and repair.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYS-050
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-SYA-018

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: KM271-HW-085
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Manufacturing
PRIORITY: Must
VERIFICATION: Inspection
COMPLIANCE: Met
